<title>USA: TABLE- MIDWEST GRAIN PRODUCTS INC Q4 LOSS.</title>
<headline>TABLE- MIDWEST GRAIN PRODUCTS INC Q4 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>ATCHISON, Kan. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		 $  0.08     loss	$ 0.08</p>
<p> Net loss		     731     loss	   814</p>
<p> Sales		     61,862		   37,856</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.01     loss	$ 0.35</p>
<p> Net profit		   131     loss	 3,406</p>
<p> Sales		    224,733		  194,638</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q4 loss reflects impact of high raw material costs for corn and milo, a substantial decrease in the selling price of the company's distillers feed, and a continued deterioration of selling prices for vital wheat gluten.</p>
<p>Periods end June 30, 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
